    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Let R be a principal ideal domain, let d be a positive integer, and let\nX1 , . . . , Xm be members of SL(d, R) (or of GL(d, R)). Is it decidable whether or\nnot these m matrices freely generate a free group? If it is, design an effective algo-\nrithm for computing the answer.                                       P. M. Neumann",
